    "args_note": "C throughout, after the reliefs (hair to the nape gathered in a bushy mass of curls, bound by the fillet; the long beard squared, in rows of curls, to the upper chest: 12 cm below the chin) and MATERIAL_CULTURE 'Hair and beards' (the elite woman's bob: B). Styles: guide curves grown in Blender (tools/blender/hair_groom.py) from roots sampled over the region mask at each layer's spacing (m); len, width, lift [root, tip] (m), segs, gravity (turn per metre), jitter (rad, sd), twist (rad, sd), tip_lift (m), both (two-sided where hanging); cls = card class. Atlas: 2048 x 4096 px, 8 columns x 8 rows (cells 256 x 512 px), rendered from hair curves in locks (locks per cell, strands per lock, lock_r / curl_r as shares of the cell's width, curl_pitch of its height, roll: the share of the length rolled into a curl at the tip); the normal atlas at half size. classRows: card class (0 scalp inner, 1 scalp outer and bun locks, 2 beard inner, 3 beard outer, 4 brows, 5 bun mass, 6 short beard) -> atlas row per hair style (0 natural, 1 court, 2 straight). The MakeHuman CC0 hair textures give each strand its shade."
